-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §50: after this part's conversion, §§39–42
-- (the role, trips and gifted-classes allowances) apply to the existing
-- academic teacher.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `50`

@ref akn:art_50
GIVEN `converted under part ח` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `sections 39 to 42 apply` `converted under part ח` IF
    `converted under part ח`

#ASSERT `sections 39 to 42 apply` TRUE
